jmbu1d3Pp7YQ7kNvwFxFlBM&_nc_oc=AdqPP1DyS3s85sriYHn-c3MphDPLllz9P-0UDsiCAol-4oPrTqCWHGoztHWkmMkcm68&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPdSU-QMl7ovgWnej1QheOYKr0sF0oVhaSnU1FO837cKg&oe=6AC7A537"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ozArv82j74UQ7kNvwFsX4Ie&_nc_oc=AdqZqW_ygxO4goG3APSCNW4QrGRRoNqZy80IFUDTSV-tHDQsx6In0IHamTO3Ozupupg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNUSN-66zIjPPNhjvQKGs-g64IeLlhi8gZrC92MLkuIzg&oe=6AC7A6CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BJrZWGU4GmgQ7kNvwEqx3-g&_nc_oc=AdrT7q5DodJADaTmkR0XjxI98rt09OdUkqhGdJrvpe0wejQf_50CXpcl2tIO9LyWLHw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNfgcvW4GQQnsta5eUrwK1DqH_vCqyklghel5Uu7BAdOg&oe=6AC7CC2F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jl9mSaWPlV0Q7kNvwETpUnm&_nc_oc=Adq8cQd2dUSO1aMmOeAL9ArIHm41ix1IwWqNKhCHJ0rSyuO1I25fiMsAXTQkz5NfqCI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOc5UFPBbomeRgXG0eHNG1v29RfMugMooWI44aLfjCTPA&oe=6AC7B583"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ia4g6PM0cL8Q7kNvwEQu7jS&_nc_oc=Ado6S6VZufjmkUPrbM5apsBmT_9vNqJ0AKAl5pxLIkw27GvBDjUzzidRWF9-pqFbX7o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOOv2KDNIJz2haKvuq-BOPsjl02gAJb8lZ5K1_yQwX5EQ&oe=6AC7ADD8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iOeOgu8ZhTwQ7kNvwGT9mFg&_nc_oc=AdpTr513hHrxToXXMmyUdONpsvn7ZQ_lCCQDaL2yVKYUTQjl2s8KldkA6r3RcYqcZLw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNmsXEwuNbQhWSqbo-RUg91b5ItCafRP0Yp6VHiKVAPgw&oe=6AC7C0FC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080